    "Can a single goods type be split across multiple containers (i.e., is it fine for type A units to be distributed among several containers), or must each type's units all go into one container?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy decision regarding whether goods of the same type can be distributed across multiple containers or must be consolidated into one."
}

{
  "action": "question",
